{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to expect in the Demo of Protect Your Humans.</strong>In this RTS Action Hero RPG, you can recruit workers who have a total of six buildings, to which they can construct. More in the full game. Learn to understand the basic controls to micro-managing your units and grow your little squad. Defend and destroy the goblin outposts that occupy the map to stop the waves of goblins from attempting to destroy your base every day. Take your little army into the dungeon to face tough and beefy enemies once the outposts have been destroyed. Enter and eliminate all the enemies in the dungeon, then a difficult raid boss awaits you.\u00a0The\u00a0Dungeon\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0demo\u00a0can\u00a0be\u00a0infinitely\u00a0replayed and the difficulty increases on each clear.<strong></strong>Skills trees are currently unable in the demo although one unique hero is available to be played with 3 unique skills to boost your fighting capabilities. One melee type, the Knight and One ranged type, the archer, who you can recruit. Upgrade your troops attack and defenses with the blacksmith and upgrade your building with the Lumber Mill.<br><br>Construct Watch Towers to defend the daily attacks.<strong><br><br>Recruit Workers to start doing your bidding in an attempt to rebuild your Fallen Kingdom!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your workers to mine gold, chop trees for lumber and build structures for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/2bf3de5fd79f42badbe657e323b5df34.poster.avif?t=1762234097\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/2bf3de5fd79f42badbe657e323b5df34.webm?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/2bf3de5fd79f42badbe657e323b5df34.mp4?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go out into the Wilderness and Hunt animals to gain extra Resources!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruiting Units requires you to gather Food.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/57ea9102aaf256deeadd4b476ee43379.poster.avif?t=1762234097\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/57ea9102aaf256deeadd4b476ee43379.webm?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/57ea9102aaf256deeadd4b476ee43379.mp4?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin Constructing your new Kingdom!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 6 different buildings to construct in the Demo. Build these to enhance your Kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/37df8e6aec6422b5263d66c77c61732d.poster.avif?t=1762234097\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/37df8e6aec6422b5263d66c77c61732d.webm?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/37df8e6aec6422b5263d66c77c61732d.mp4?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend against the Raid Boss's Army of Monsters!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, waves of Goblins seek your base to destroy it. Defend against these.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/f9382220834e812c7f7495ddd6f72a78.poster.avif?t=1762234097\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/f9382220834e812c7f7495ddd6f72a78.webm?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/f9382220834e812c7f7495ddd6f72a78.mp4?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Loyal Knights, Archers and Heroes who will help you on your Dangerous Adventures!\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your little army and destroy the goblin outposts to stop the daily invasion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/dcbdc9ba8eb7ce57cf6df494ef11801e.poster.avif?t=1762234097\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/dcbdc9ba8eb7ce57cf6df494ef11801e.webm?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/dcbdc9ba8eb7ce57cf6df494ef11801e.mp4?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delve into the dungeon and defeat the Raid Bosses!\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating the goblins, find their Master in the Dungeon and defeat him.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/30f1c328de6d3783067df55f510d1d58.poster.avif?t=1762234097\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/30f1c328de6d3783067df55f510d1d58.webm?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/30f1c328de6d3783067df55f510d1d58.mp4?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113100?t=1762234097","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/9e4ec64252fdc4349a0f613b0635b53cf48b50cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762234097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/8b06ee9f0a6cba344280ea443ee6e8bba55e4b01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762234097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/8b06ee9f0a6cba344280ea443ee6e8bba55e4b01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762234097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to expect in the Demo of Protect Your Humans.</strong>In this RTS Action Hero RPG, you can recruit workers who have a total of six buildings, to which they can construct. More in the full game. Learn to understand the basic controls to micro-managing your units and grow your little squad. Defend and destroy the goblin outposts that occupy the map to stop the waves of goblins from attempting to destroy your base every day. Take your little army into the dungeon to face tough and beefy enemies once the outposts have been destroyed. Enter and eliminate all the enemies in the dungeon, then a difficult raid boss awaits you.\u00a0The\u00a0Dungeon\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0demo\u00a0can\u00a0be\u00a0infinitely\u00a0replayed and the difficulty increases on each clear.<strong></strong>Skills trees are currently unable in the demo although one unique hero is available to be played with 3 unique skills to boost your fighting capabilities. One melee type, the Knight and One ranged type, the archer, who you can recruit. Upgrade your troops attack and defenses with the blacksmith and upgrade your building with the Lumber Mill.<br><br>Construct Watch Towers to defend the daily attacks.<strong><br><br>Recruit Workers to start doing your bidding in an attempt to rebuild your Fallen Kingdom!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your workers to mine gold, chop trees for lumber and build structures for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/2bf3de5fd79f42badbe657e323b5df34.poster.avif?t=1762234097\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/2bf3de5fd79f42badbe657e323b5df34.webm?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113100/extras/2bf3de5fd79f42badbe657e323b5df34.mp4?t=1762234097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go out into the Wilderness and Hunt animals to gain extra Resources!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruiting Units requires you to gather Food.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video